OL,3,GNEWSAPrime minister visits Aberfan
OL,4,Aahead of 60th anniversary of
OL,5,A'horrifying tragedy'
OL,6,
OL,7,F"It's been 60 years since one of the
OL,8,Fmost horrifying tragedies this country
OL,9,Fhas ever seen. All of those children
OL,10,Flost," Burnham said.
OL,12,FOn 21 October 1966, 116 children and 28
OL,13,Fadults were killed when a colliery
OL,14,Fspoil tip collapsed, catastrophically
OL,15,Fengulfing a primary school and
OL,16,Fsurrounding houses.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
